      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry, I'm a bit confused. Why are you talking about goblins and \"goblin food\"? I'm really just trying to understand the physics for my exam. Can you please ignore the metaphors and just explain the actual mechanism of how the oscillating voltage affects the charge on the plates?",
